    <item>
      <title>From: R.G., To: Martin Chandler</title>
      <link>//localhost:1313/1900/08/02/50/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 02 Aug 1900 23:46:23 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>//localhost:1313/1900/08/02/50/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://107.170.91.122/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/postcard-2014-20140407_17494216_0001.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140407_17494216_0001&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;http://107.170.91.122/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/postcard-2014-20140407_17494216_0001.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://107.170.91.122/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/postcard-2014-20140407_17494998_0002.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140407_17494998_0002&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;http://107.170.91.122/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/postcard-2014-20140407_17494998_0002.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://107.170.91.122/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/postcard-2014-20140407_17494216_0001.jpg&#34;&gt;  &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From: R.G., To: Martin Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Atwater, Illinois on August 2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Martin Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Ill&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Well Mister,&lt;br&gt;
When are you going to have a game. I will be there Tuesday not before. Cannot do it.&lt;br&gt;
For now,&lt;br&gt;
R.G.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
